{"version":1,"content":"<p>法新社周六（31日）報道，東非島國馬達加斯加執法部門在美國協助下，於8月至9月展開聯合行動，搗破13個由中國公民營運的電騙園區，其中單一天就檢獲約5200萬美元（約4.05億港元）加密貨幣，並充公超過3200個電子設備。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.062450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:10:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.874036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_hash":"1b648595cfb52a5aba0b78ea66e39ecd5c1e9344319049902f52e833bff4de41","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}